            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Add a variable called <code>weight</code> to the class definition and set <code>\"19.8\"</code> as its value.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Pokemon\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;squirtle&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  weight = \" /><text value=\"&quot;19.8&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pokemon = Pokemon()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(pokemon.name)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(pokemon.weight)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"name\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"squirtle\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"19.8\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>weight</code>, followed by <code>=</code>, and finally <code>\"19.8\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
